## Total

**2 faces, 357,288 B (~349 KiB)** of font bytes, plus license text (~1.5 KiB
per family). Both faces are *variable* fonts on their remaining axis (`wght`),
so this pair covers the whole weight range the catalog names instead of one
file per weight. Subsetting to a narrower glyph range is a documented
**deferred optimization**, as it is for Glyph and shadcn.
